== Trivia ==
* This challenge is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Team Fortress 2|Team Fortress 2]]'''s 4th class, the Demoman. In the game, the Demoman uses a sticky bomb launcher, that launches bombs which can be manually detonated, much like the combination of the two items this challenge revolves around.

